{
    "background_story": "Lia was a talented sculptor known for her innovative use of materials and techniques. Her latest project, a massive installation titled 'Elevated', featured a series of sleek, modern sculptures mounted on a socle, a type of pedestal that added an air of elegance to each piece. The socle, designed by Lia herself, was a masterpiece of minimalist design, subtly elevating the sculptures to create a sense of drama and tension. As the exhibition opened, Lia's work was met with critical acclaim, with many praising the way the socle enhanced the overall impact of the sculptures. For Lia, the socle was more than just a base \u2013 it was an integral part of the artwork, a reflection of her attention to detail and commitment to creating a cohesive, visually stunning experience.",
